# 剧院幕后：手机造景贴纸框架

本关使用用户提供的 theatre-complete-sticker-kit-v2 素材，原画尺寸 1672×941，包含 61 张完整逻辑贴纸、7 个区域。最终目标是微信小游戏、iOS 和 Android。手机玩法核心与素材排布独立于浏览器。

## 现在可以使用什么

| 文件或目录 | 用途 |
| --- | --- |
| `wechat/` | 可导入微信开发者工具的小游戏源码，入口及资源分包已生成 |
| `cocos-import/` | Cocos Creator 3.8.x 的 App 组件、共享状态逻辑和资源导入目录 |
| `data/theatre-layout.json` | 本图真实排布，支持后续手动调整 |
| `src/core/` | 区域推进、L1/L2/L3、贴合事务、撤回、版本化存档和排布校验 |
| `src/rendering/` | 微信画布渲染、纸张动画与金属镊子 |
| `src/adapters/` | 微信 API 宿主及 Cocos 原生 Sprite 组件 |
| `preview/` | 独立的浏览器诊断宿主，方便先审查手感和画面 |
| `docs/` | 素材约定、平台接入、底图清理与验证记录 |

同级的“剧院幕后-交互验证.html”可直接打开，支持鼠标和手机触控。它用于确认玩法与画面；发布工程使用上面的微信入口或 Cocos 组件。

## 区域推进

| 顺序 | 区域 | L1 | L2 | L3 | 合计 |
| ---: | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 1 | 梳妆与服装区 | 1 | 2 | 1 | 4 |
| 2 | 裁缝与布料区 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 12 |
| 3 | 左翼装置 | 1 | 0 | 3 | 4 |
| 4 | 主舞台 | 0 | 8 | 0 | 8 |
| 5 | 排练区 | 0 | 3 | 0 | 3 |
| 6 | 道具制作区 | 3 | 10 | 7 | 20 |
| 7 | 乐池 | 1 | 9 | 0 | 10 |

自动放大当前区域。该区域所有贴纸完成后，播放星光，再退回整图、停留、放大下一区域。空的面积阶段自动跳过，不为了凑齐 L1/L2/L3 把人物拆成地板切片。

轻点纸栏拿取，点当前阴影位置粘贴，也可拖放。只有拿起贴纸时显示目标阴影。拿取折角保持较小，钢制弯尖镊子带粉色圆点与花纹。贴放共 1550 毫秒，从左向右压平；星光 1350 毫秒；区域镜头依次 700/450/800 毫秒。动画完成后才记录贴好，途中切后台或取消不会提前加进度。

撤回可以返回已完成的区域。本机自动保存进度与编辑稿。微信完成画面可以由用户主动保存成原尺寸 PNG。

## 遮挡与素材

61 张逻辑贴纸含 66 个实际绘制部件，另有 25 个固定层。全部共用 91 项全局绘制队列，按 placementOrder 从小到大绘制，后绘制覆盖前绘制。跨桌面的人物身体与前手分别保留自己的层级，但只作为一张贴纸取放、计数和调整。

16 件条件附属物随支持贴纸的位置、锚点、缩放和旋转一起变化。包括礼服人台、工作台上的工具与布料。它们只有在支持贴纸贴好后显示，避免初始悬浮；编辑时点附属物可以选中所属整组。

原画、独立透明 PNG、原始底图均保留。清理后的有效底图由 `scene.baseAssetKey` 与 `scene.basePatches` 合成；局部补片用于清除最后一个小瓶残影，不计入贴纸。不要只取裸底图并漏掉补片。底图是内置 ImageGen 生成的派生版本，存在色彩、纹理和镜中固定人物的差异，不能称为原画逐像素复原。完整素材边缘沿用原包质量，没有把小尺寸原件重绘成高清图。

## 接入手机平台

微信：导入 `wechat/`，选择小游戏，填写自己的小游戏 AppID。详见 `docs/微信小游戏接入.md`。

App：在 Cocos Creator 3.8.x 新建 2D 项目，把 `cocos-import/assets/` 内容合并到项目 assets；在 2D Canvas 下创建带 UITransform 和四边对齐 Widget 的节点，挂载 TheatreGame。详见 `cocos-import/README.md`。编辑器生成场景与资源标识，本包没有手写假 `.scene`、`.meta` 或安装包。

当前机器没有 Cocos 编辑器、微信开发者工具及移动平台编译 SDK。因此已验证源码、状态和诊断交互；尚未完成微信真机、Cocos GPU 场景、iOS/Android 安装包和发布验收。

## 重建微信源码及诊断预览

安装 Node.js 和项目依赖后运行：

```sh
npm install
npm run build
npm test
```

构建会编译 TypeScript、同步当前 JSON 和所需 PNG、生成 Cocos 导入目录及单文件诊断预览。只同步运行用资源，清理平台副本中已废弃的补底版本；原始资源资料不会被改写。Cocos 组件由目标 Creator 项目使用引擎类型与编译器构建。

编辑器里可以移动、等比缩放、旋转及前后调层，导入/导出完整 JSON。只改参数；原 PNG、部件 offset 和固定支撑关系受保护。保存新排布会采用新版本并重开该版本的试玩进度，旧版本存档保留。

## 本次验证

共享状态的 17 项检查通过；真实 Canvas 配合模拟微信接口完成全部 61 张与 7 区，并验证取消、多指、后台恢复、PNG 导出、JSON 导入导出、草稿冷启动与附属物变换。三个浏览器尺寸的真实触控/鼠标诊断通过。全部 61 件逐项视觉复核，默认 91 层合成未见明显可玩残影、重复主体或新增支撑错位。

Cocos 使用官方 3.8.8 API 声明完成严格类型检查，33 项几何/导入检查、9 项组件宿主模拟检查及 97 张 PNG 的透明点击数据复核通过。这些检查的范围与原始记录见 `docs/verification/`，不等同于真机或引擎画面已验收。
import { validateLayout } from './GameSession';

/** Gameplay validation alone is insufficient for externally imported artwork layouts. */
export function validateRenderableLayout(value: any, source?: any): string[] {
  const errors = validateLayout(value);
  if (!value || typeof value !== 'object') return errors;
  if (errors.length) return errors;
  const validNumber = (n: any) => typeof n === 'number' && Number.isFinite(n);
  const size = (s: any) => s && validNumber(s.width) && validNumber(s.height) && s.width > 0 && s.height > 0;
  const point = (p: any) => p && validNumber(p.x) && validNumber(p.y);
  const polygonPoint = (p: any) => Array.isArray(p) ? p.length === 2 && p.every(validNumber) : point(p);
  const rect = (r: any) => point(r) && size(r);
  const dependencies = (ids: any) => Array.isArray(ids) && ids.every(id => typeof id === 'string' && value.stickers.some((s: any) => s?.stickerId === id));
  const asset = (key: any) => typeof key === 'string' && key.startsWith('resources/') && !key.split('/').includes('..') && !key.includes(':') && !key.includes('\\');
  if (!size(value.scene) || !asset(value.scene?.baseAssetKey) || !asset(value.scene?.referenceAssetKey)) errors.push('scene dimensions and artwork keys are required');
  if (value.scene?.basePatches !== undefined && !Array.isArray(value.scene.basePatches)) errors.push('basePatches must be an array');
  else for (const p of value.scene?.basePatches || []) if (!p || !asset(p.assetKey) || !point(p.position) || !size(p.sourceSize) || !size(p.size)) errors.push('invalid background repair tile');
  if (!Number.isSafeInteger(value.layoutRevision) || value.layoutRevision < 1) errors.push('renderable layoutRevision must be a positive integer');
  if (!Array.isArray(value.fixedLayers) || !Array.isArray(value.renderOrder) || !Array.isArray(value.stickers)) return [...errors, 'fixedLayers, renderOrder and stickers are required'];
  if (!value.stickers.length) errors.push('a renderable scene must contain stickers');
  for (const b of value.geoBlocks || []) {
    if (!b || !rect(b.bounds) || !rect(b.cameraBounds) || !Array.isArray(b.polygon) || b.polygon.length < 3 || !b.polygon.every(polygonPoint)) errors.push('geometric blocks require valid bounds, camera bounds and polygons');
  }
  const parts = new Map<string, any>();
  const logical = new Map<string, any>();
  const fixed = new Map<string, any>();
  for (const s of value.stickers) {
    if (!s || !asset(s.assetKey) || !size(s.sourceSize)) { errors.push('invalid sticker artwork'); continue; }
    logical.set(s.stickerId, s);
    if (!Array.isArray(s.renderParts) || !s.renderParts.length) { errors.push(`${s.stickerId} requires complete renderParts`); continue; }
    for (const p of s.renderParts) {
      if (!p || typeof p.partId !== 'string' || parts.has(p.partId) || !asset(p.assetKey) || !size(p.sourceSize) || !point(p.offset) || !Number.isSafeInteger(p.layerIndex) || !dependencies(p.requiresAssetIds)) errors.push(`${s.stickerId} invalid render part`);
      else parts.set(p.partId, p);
    }
  }
  for (const f of value.fixedLayers) {
    if (!f || typeof f.fixedId !== 'string' || fixed.has(f.fixedId) || !asset(f.assetKey) || !size(f.sourceSize) || !point(f.position) || !point(f.anchor) || !validNumber(f.scale) || f.scale <= 0 || !validNumber(f.rotation) || !Number.isSafeInteger(f.layerIndex) || !dependencies(f.requiresAssetIds)) errors.push('invalid fixed layer');
    else fixed.set(f.fixedId, f);
    if (f?.attachment && (!point(f.attachment.offset) || !logical.has(f.attachment.stickerId) || f.attachment.inheritTransform !== true || !Array.isArray(f.requiresAssetIds) || !f.requiresAssetIds.includes(f.attachment.stickerId))) errors.push('invalid fixed-layer attachment');
  }
  const keys = new Set<string>(), orders = new Set<number>();
  for (const e of value.renderOrder) {
    if (!e || !['fixed', 'stickerPart'].includes(e.kind) || !Number.isSafeInteger(e.layerIndex) || !Number.isSafeInteger(e.placementOrder) || e.placementOrder <= 0 || orders.has(e.placementOrder)) { errors.push('invalid global paint order'); continue; }
    orders.add(e.placementOrder);
    const key = e.kind === 'fixed' ? `fixed:${e.fixedId}` : `part:${e.partId}`;
    const target = e.kind === 'fixed' ? fixed.get(e.fixedId) : parts.get(e.partId);
    if (!target || keys.has(key) || target.placementOrder !== e.placementOrder || target.layerIndex !== e.layerIndex) errors.push(`invalid paint entry ${key}`);
    if (e.kind === 'stickerPart' && !logical.get(e.stickerId)?.renderParts?.some((p: any) => p.partId === e.partId)) errors.push('paint owner mismatch');
    keys.add(key);
  }
  if (keys.size !== parts.size + fixed.size) errors.push('global painter queue must include every part and fixed layer exactly once');
  if (errors.length) return errors;
  if (source) {
    const equal = (a: any, b: any) => JSON.stringify(a) === JSON.stringify(b);
    if (value.sceneId !== source.sceneId || !equal([value.scene?.width, value.scene?.height, value.scene?.baseAssetKey, value.scene?.referenceAssetKey, value.scene?.basePatches], [source.scene.width, source.scene.height, source.scene.baseAssetKey, source.scene.referenceAssetKey, source.scene.basePatches])) errors.push('import cannot replace scene artwork');
    const srcIds = source.stickers.map((s: any) => s.stickerId).sort();
    if (!equal([...logical.keys()].sort(), srcIds)) errors.push('import must retain the original logical sticker inventory');
    for (const original of source.stickers) {
      const s = logical.get(original.stickerId);
      if (!s || s.assetKey !== original.assetKey || !equal(s.sourceSize, original.sourceSize)) { errors.push('import cannot replace sticker pixels or dimensions'); continue; }
      if (!Array.isArray(s.renderParts) || s.renderParts.length !== original.renderParts.length) { errors.push('import cannot remove multipart geometry'); continue; }
      for (const oldPart of original.renderParts) {
        const p = s.renderParts.find((p: any) => p.partId === oldPart.partId);
        if (!p || p.assetKey !== oldPart.assetKey || !equal(p.offset, oldPart.offset) || !equal(p.sourceSize, oldPart.sourceSize)) errors.push('import cannot replace part pixels, offsets or dimensions');
      }
    }
    if (!equal([...fixed.keys()].sort(), source.fixedLayers.map((f: any) => f.fixedId).sort())) errors.push('import must retain fixed environment layers');
    for (const f of source.fixedLayers) {
      const candidate = fixed.get(f.fixedId);
      if (!candidate || !equal([candidate.assetKey, candidate.sourceSize, candidate.position, candidate.anchor, candidate.scale, candidate.rotation, candidate.requiresAssetIds, candidate.attachment], [f.assetKey, f.sourceSize, f.position, f.anchor, f.scale, f.rotation, f.requiresAssetIds, f.attachment])) errors.push('import cannot alter fixed environment artwork');
    }
    if (!equal((value.geoBlocks || []).map((b: any) => b.blockId).sort(), source.geoBlocks.map((b: any) => b.blockId).sort())) errors.push('import must retain the known geometric blocks');
  }
  return errors;
}

/**
 * Platform-neutral sticker state. Coordinates remain in the layout's world space.
 * A native touch adapter and renderer own hit testing, camera motion and animation;
 * only commitPlacement(ticket), after animation, changes saved progress.
 */
export type AreaLevel = 'L1' | 'L2' | 'L3';
export type SessionPhase = 'playing' | 'placing' | 'transitioning' | 'completed';
export type LayoutRevision = string | number;
export interface Point { x: number; y: number }
export interface Size { width: number; height: number }
export interface RenderPart {
  partId: string;
  placementOrder: number;
  paintOrder?: number;
  layerIndex: number;
  offset: Point;
  [key: string]: unknown;
}
export interface RenderQueueEntry {
  kind: 'stickerPart' | 'fixed';
  stickerId?: string;
  partId?: string;
  fixedId?: string;
  placementOrder: number;
  paintOrder?: number;
  layerIndex: number;
  [key: string]: unknown;
}
export interface FixedPlacement {
  fixedId: string;
  placementOrder: number;
  paintOrder?: number;
  layerIndex: number;
  [key: string]: unknown;
}
export interface GeoBlock {
  blockId: string;
  blockOrder: number;
  [key: string]: unknown;
}
export interface StickerPlacement {
  stickerId: string;
  geoBlock: string;
  areaLevel: AreaLevel;
  placementOrder: number;
  layerIndex: number;
  position: Point;
  anchor: Point;
  sourceSize: Size;
  scale: number;
  rotation: number;
  dependsOn?: string[];
  renderParts?: RenderPart[];
  [key: string]: unknown;
}
export interface GameLayout {
  sceneId: string;
  layoutRevision: LayoutRevision;
  geoBlocks: GeoBlock[];
  stickers: StickerPlacement[];
  renderParts?: Record<string, unknown>[];
  renderOrder?: RenderQueueEntry[];
  fixedLayers?: FixedPlacement[];
  [key: string]: unknown;
}
export interface PlacementTicket { stickerId: string; transactionId: number }
export interface BlockProgress {
  blockId: string;
  blockOrder: number;
  placed: number;
  total: number;
  completed: boolean;
}
export interface SessionSnapshot {
  sceneId: string;
  layoutRevision: LayoutRevision;
  revision: number;
  phase: SessionPhase;
  activeBlockId: string | null;
  activeAreaLevel: AreaLevel | null;
  selectedStickerId: string | null;
  pendingPlacement: PlacementTicket | null;
  /** Ready stickers in the active stage; global render order breaks ties. */
  availableStickerIds: string[];
  /** Chronological successful placements, for undo and prefix validation. */
  placedStickerIds: string[];
  /** The whole scene's placed sticker IDs sorted by global placementOrder. */
  renderStickerIds: string[];
  progress: { placed: number; total: number; blocks: BlockProgress[] };
  /** Selection/placement lock. Completed scenes can still allow undo. */
  interactionLocked: boolean;
  canUndo: boolean;
}
export interface SessionSave {
  schemaVersion: 'sticker-session-v1';
  sceneId: string;
  layoutRevision: LayoutRevision;
  placedStickerIds: string[];
  activeBlockId: string | null;
  transitionPending: boolean;
}
export type SessionEventType =
  | 'selected' | 'selection-cancelled' | 'placement-started'
  | 'placement-cancelled' | 'placed' | 'transition-finished'
  | 'undo' | 'restored';
export interface SessionEvent {
  type: SessionEventType;
  revision: number;
  stickerId?: string;
  completedBlockId?: string;
  nextBlockId?: string | null;
}
export type SessionListener = (snapshot: SessionSnapshot, event: SessionEvent) => void;
export interface RestoreResult { ok: boolean; errors: string[] }

const AREA_LEVELS: AreaLevel[] = ['L1', 'L2', 'L3'];
const levelRank = (level: AreaLevel): number => AREA_LEVELS.indexOf(level);
const record = (value: unknown): value is Record<string, unknown> =>
  value !== null && typeof value === 'object' && !Array.isArray(value);
const finite = (value: unknown): value is number =>
  typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value);
const integer = (value: unknown): value is number =>
  finite(value) && Number.isSafeInteger(value);
const identifier = (value: unknown): value is string =>
  typeof value === 'string' && value.length > 0 && value.trim() === value;
const clone = <T>(value: T): T => JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value)) as T;

/** Structural and gameplay validation; no engine or filesystem dependency. */
export function validateLayout(value: unknown): string[] {
  const errors: string[] = [];
  if (!record(value)) return ['layout must be an object'];
  if (!identifier(value.sceneId)) errors.push('sceneId must be a nonempty string');
  if (!identifier(value.layoutRevision) && !(integer(value.layoutRevision) && value.layoutRevision >= 0)) {
    errors.push('layoutRevision must be a nonempty string or nonnegative safe integer');
  }
  if (!Array.isArray(value.geoBlocks)) errors.push('geoBlocks must be an array');
  if (!Array.isArray(value.stickers)) errors.push('stickers must be an array');
  if (errors.length) return errors;
  const blockOrders = new Set<number>();
  const blocks = new Map<string, GeoBlock>();
  for (const [index, entry] of Array.from(value.geoBlocks as unknown[]).entries()) {
    const label = `geoBlocks[${index}]`;
    if (!record(entry)) { errors.push(`${label} must be an object`); continue; }
    if (!identifier(entry.blockId)) errors.push(`${label}.blockId must be nonempty`);
    else if (blocks.has(entry.blockId)) errors.push(`duplicate blockId ${entry.blockId}`);
    else blocks.set(entry.blockId, entry as unknown as GeoBlock);
    if (!integer(entry.blockOrder) || entry.blockOrder < 0) {
      errors.push(`${label}.blockOrder must be a nonnegative safe integer`);
    } else if (blockOrders.has(entry.blockOrder)) {
      errors.push(`duplicate blockOrder ${entry.blockOrder}`);
    } else blockOrders.add(entry.blockOrder);
  }
  const stickers = new Map<string, StickerPlacement>();
  const renderOrders = new Set<number>();
  for (const [index, entry] of Array.from(value.stickers as unknown[]).entries()) {
    const label = `stickers[${index}]`;
    if (!record(entry)) { errors.push(`${label} must be an object`); continue; }
    if (!identifier(entry.stickerId)) errors.push(`${label}.stickerId must be nonempty`);
    else if (stickers.has(entry.stickerId)) errors.push(`duplicate stickerId ${entry.stickerId}`);
    else stickers.set(entry.stickerId, entry as unknown as StickerPlacement);
    if (!identifier(entry.geoBlock) || !blocks.has(entry.geoBlock)) {
      errors.push(`${label}.geoBlock must reference an existing block`);
    }
    if (!AREA_LEVELS.includes(entry.areaLevel as AreaLevel)) errors.push(`${label}.areaLevel must be L1, L2 or L3`);
    if (!integer(entry.placementOrder) || entry.placementOrder < 0) {
      errors.push(`${label}.placementOrder must be a nonnegative safe integer`);
    } else if (renderOrders.has(entry.placementOrder)) {
